        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>7mm Passage Spindle for Omnia Lever and Knob Sets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n7mm square solid spindle. For use with <a href=\"/collections/omnia-levers\"><b>Omnia Brass Leversets</b></a> and <a href=\"/collections/omnia-knobs\"><b>Omnia Brass Knobsets</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a 7mm solid spindle used for <b>Passage (Hall and Closet) function</b> only.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/7mm-privacy-spindle-for-omnia-lever-and-knob-sets\"><b>Omnia 7mm swivel spindle</b></a> for <b>Privacy (Bed or Bathroom) function</b>. \r\n<br>*Not for use with <a href=\"/collections/omnia-stainless-steel-levers\"><b>Omnia Stainless Steel Leversets</b></a>, use <a href=\"/products/8mm-passage-spindle-for-omnia-stainless-steel-lever\"><b>Omnia 8mm solid passage spindle</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 different lengths</b>.\r\n<br>\r\nOMN-007/4: 7mm x <b>4 Inches Long</b> (for 1-3/8\" thick doors). \r\n<br>\r\nOMN-007/4.5: 7mm x <b>4-1/2 Inches Long</b> (for 1-3/4\" thick doors). \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a 7mm solid spindle used for <b>Passage (Hall and Closet) function</b> only.\r\n</p>",
